  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>In order to calculate the enthalpy change for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> to ice at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we need to calculate the enthalpy change of all the transformation involved in the process.</p><p>(a) Energy change of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mfenced><mi>l</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>l</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></p><p>(b) Energy change of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>l</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>ice</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></p><p>(c) Energy change of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></math>, Ice <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mfenced></math>, at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;Ice <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></p><p>Total <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;H</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#916;T</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#916;H</mi></math> freezing <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#916;T</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>75</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>36</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>56</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;(exothermic process)</p><p>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>56</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>.</p>"
